  "title": "LoadingSceneTransition",
  "description": "Covers the screen while the incoming scene prepares, then removes the overlay as soon as the scene switch commits. There is no fixed delay. Reuse the transition across navigations. Each navigation owns its overlay and frees it on completion, cancellation, or load failure.",
